{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "Sir, regarding the ten electronic test cables: the calibration desk confirmed that all ten failed their scheduled calibration check but remain suitable for controlled calibration return. They must be sent to the calibration desk with a calibration request dated Tuesday. The signed calibration worksheet is currently awaiting property-section filing."}
